From: ShareOS <noreply@github.com>
Subject: [PATCH] mdadm.h: include libgen.h for basename() (musl, GCC 14)

musl does not declare the GNU basename() in <string.h>; with GCC 14 the
implicit declaration is an error (Monitor.c, platform-intel.c, super-intel.c).

--- a/mdadm.h
+++ b/mdadm.h
@@ -36,2 +36,3 @@
 #include	<assert.h>
+#include	<libgen.h>
 #include	<sys/types.h>
